<title>BRAZIL: Brazil monthly soybean and product shipment.</title>
<headline>Brazil monthly soybean and product shipment.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS do Brasil reported the following Brazilian soybean and products shipments in the month ending April 30 compared with the previous month and the corresponding month last year, in tonnes -</p>
<p>Month ending  Month ending  Month ending</p>
<p> .	  30/04/97	31/03/97	28/04/96</p>
<p> Bean    1,205,200	 725,900	 818,700</p>
<p> Meal    1,204,500	 582,000	 780,700</p>
<p> Oil	 118,800	  48,900	 112,900</p>
</text>
